---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<section class="desk" id="desk"><div class="desk-heading"><h2>发哥的桌面</h2><span>移动鼠标，看看它们的小脾气。<br>也可以点开，慢慢翻。</span></div><div class="desk-items">
<button class="desk-item skill" data-note="0" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="resource-modal" aria-haspopup="dialog"><span class="object-stage"><img src={`${base}assets/skill.webp`} alt="" class="object-image"><i class="spark">✦</i><span class="object-whisper">开箱，带走一个好用的 Skill</span></span><span class="item-caption"><strong>Skill 盒</strong></span></button>
<button class="desk-item news" data-note="1" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="resource-modal" aria-haspopup="dialog"><span class="object-stage"><img src={`${base}assets/news.webp`} alt="" class="object-image"><i class="spark">NEW</i><span class="object-whisper">今天的 AI，又有新鲜事</span></span><span class="item-caption"><strong>AI 资讯</strong></span></button>
<button class="desk-item notebook" data-note="2" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="resource-modal" aria-haspopup="dialog"><span class="object-stage"><img src={`${base}assets/notebook.webp`} alt="" class="object-image"><i class="spark">↗</i><span class="object-whisper">翻一页，把方法留下</span></span><span class="item-caption"><strong>教程笔记</strong></span></button>
<button class="desk-item game" data-note="3" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="resource-modal" aria-haspopup="dialog"><span class="object-stage"><img src={`${base}assets/game.webp`} alt="" class="object-image"><i class="spark">＋</i><span class="object-whisper">工作暂停，先来一局</span></span><span class="item-caption"><strong>游戏体验</strong></span></button>
</div></section>